Z||000005||Blondie88||10-26-2001||02:55 AM||||I have that nice of teeth!! I just got my braces off 2 days ago.  I know...braces at 19, back off.  But I looked up the word fiero and found that in French and Dutch it means proud, and if you go from french to german or finnish or something in means trots!  Sunglass guy wasn't sure you guys would know.  I told him that you would! ||||reg||1
