Z||000008||Blondie88||10-26-2001||01:28 PM||||Sorry, my parents own a kiosk in the mall here in reno selling their phone company, and there's a guy behind me that sells sunglasses.  I always forget his name, so we call him the sunglass guy.  He came over and I was looking at fieros, then we started talking about what it meant, and he didn't think you guys would know.  SO I put it in here to prove you would!  So that is the legend of the sunglass guy. ||||reg||1
